(                       OVERWEIGHT AND ITS DANGERS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Anyone who is 15 or more pounds heavier than his desirable weight is) Tj T*
(considered overweight. For those still in their 20?s or younger a) Tj T*
(_little_ extra weight does no harm. For people over 30 it is not good.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
