(Overweight is a danger signal, particularly for those over 40. Studies) Tj T*
(of life insurance figures show that overweight people develop diabetes,) Tj T*
(heart disease, high blood pressure, and other life-shortening conditions) Tj T*
(earlier, and are apt to die younger, than people whose weight is normal.) Tj T*
(They are poor surgical risks and have less resistance to infection.) Tj T*
(Stout women are more likely to develop complications in pregnancy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_What Makes a Person Fat?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Most people are fat simply because they eat too much. This does not) Tj T*
(necessarily mean that they stuff themselves with large quantities of) Tj T*
(food. It does mean that they take in more calories[2] than their bodies) Tj T*
(can use. This is often surprisingly easy to do, particularly for a) Tj T*
(person who has poor eating habits.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Some people blame their overweight on metabolism \(the rate at which) Tj T*
(their bodies use energy\) and on the glands which regulate metabolism. In) Tj T*
(a very few cases, poorly functioning glands may _contribute_ to) Tj T*
(overweight. Even then, the overweight patient who is under a physician?s) Tj T*
(treatment for glandular disorders is able to lose weight when his food) Tj T*
(intake is regulated.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What many people do not realize, however, is that the body?s energy) Tj T*
(requirements usually change after age 30 or 40. As a person gets older,) Tj T*
(metabolism slows down, and fewer calories are needed to maintain weight.) Tj T*
(The trouble is that eating habits usually stay exactly the same, while) Tj T*
(physical activity often decreases.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Heredity is often claimed as a cause of overweight. Careful studies do) Tj T*
(not bear this out. Heredity does determine the type of body build a) Tj T*
(person has, but when people from overweight families change their eating) Tj T*
(habits it has been proved that they, too, can lose weight.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Actually, most overweight people readily admit that their excess) Tj T*
(poundage comes from overeating. They say they just don?t seem to be able) Tj T*
(to stop. Knowing why a thing is hard to do sometimes makes it easier to) Tj T*
(change.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_Why Do People Overeat?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Many people eat more than they need for reasons that have little to do) Tj T*
(with hunger. Habit is one of them. Eating habits are set in patterns) Tj T*
(which have often been followed for years. Such patterns are not always) Tj T*
(easy to change, but with persistence and determination they can be) Tj T*
(altered.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Some people develop the habit of overeating because good food and plenty) Tj T*
(of it is a family tradition. Some fall into the habit because of) Tj T*
(sociability. They eat more frequently and so consume greater amounts of) Tj T*
(food than they need. Some people consider food as a symbol of success or) Tj T*
ET
