(restrictions on cakes, pastries, extra butter, rich sauces, cocktails,) Tj T*
(beer, soft drinks, and other high-calorie favorites, it is a hard one) Tj T*
(for many people to accept. Nevertheless, it must be accepted by everyone) Tj T*
(who wants to lose weight.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Few people claim that the first days on a reducing diet are happy ones.) Tj T*
(Some individuals find it easier to adjust than others, but all agree) Tj T*
(that the period of discomfort does not last too long if they persevere.) Tj T*
(They also claim that a wonderful feeling of physical vigor and) Tj T*
(liberation follows as they lose weight. The ability to bend down again) Tj T*
(with ease, the disappearance of unsightly bulges, and the pleasure of) Tj T*
(buying smaller sizes in clothes are among the things which amply) Tj T*
(compensate for any early discomfort.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_The Body?s Need for Exercise_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every healthy person needs some exercise. Daily physical exertion is) Tj T*
(good for muscle tone and circulation. It also helps to relieve the) Tj T*
(tension many people pile up in the course of a day?s work.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Regular exercise, if not carried to the point of increasing hunger, can) Tj T*
(help in a reducing program, because the more active a person is, the) Tj T*
(more calories he needs to burn. But for the overweight individual,) Tj T*
(exercise can never replace eating less. A person would have to walk) Tj T*
(about five miles to use up the calories in one chocolate sundae. He) Tj T*
(would have to saw wood for an hour or so to offset a piece of apple pie,) Tj T*
(or walk about a mile to work off two graham crackers. Obviously, it is) Tj T*
(simpler to avoid eating the sundae, the pie, or the crackers than to try) Tj T*
(to exercise them off.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The decision about exercising while losing weight should be left to the) Tj T*
(physician supervising the reducing program. The kind and amount of extra) Tj T*
(physical activity which he advises will depend on age, physical) Tj T*
(condition, and previous habits. For children and young patients he will) Tj T*
(probably advise lots of exercise and active sports. For older people he) Tj T*
(may not prescribe anything more strenuous than walking. For people with) Tj T*
(heart or circulatory conditions, he may caution against any exercise.) Tj T*
(The necessity for tailoring the treatment to the individual in this way) Tj T*
(is one of the reasons why a reducing program should be undertaken only) Tj T*
(under medical supervision.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_What About Short Cuts?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(No one who has taken on the job of losing weight will say that the) Tj T*
(self-denial involved is pleasant. It is only natural to wonder if there) Tj T*
(isn?t an easier way: What about drugs, steam baths, massage, or other) Tj T*
(quick methods?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Any drug which can increase the body?s rate of burning calories enough) Tj T*
(to effect weight reduction without dieting is dangerous. One drug,) Tj T*
