(released in the early 1930?s without medical sanction, ?worked?; but it) Tj T*
(also caused deafness, blindness, and paralysis before it was withdrawn) Tj T*
(from the market. Even if drugs are prescribed by a physician, they will) Tj T*
(be used in addition to?not in place of?a diet.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Many people wonder about steam baths and massage as a short cut. Steam) Tj T*
(baths are often a delusion. The profuse sweating which a steam bath) Tj T*
(induces is apt to cause a sudden drop in weight because of water loss.) Tj T*
(Thirst soon makes the average person replace the lost water, and his) Tj T*
(weight is usually exactly what it was before.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Swedish massage is a relaxing luxury for those who can afford it. It is) Tj T*
(good for the circulation, and helps to keep tissues in firm condition.) Tj T*
(However, it will not take off pounds nor allow additions to the diet.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Nobody likes to believe unpleasant truths. Therefore, the search for) Tj T*
(short cuts goes on. Ten-day wonder diets; special foods; spot-reducing) Tj T*
(gadgets?many of these fads are harmless, though expensive and) Tj T*
(ineffective. Some suggest, in small print, that special low-calorie) Tj T*
(diets should be followed, thus acknowledging the disagreeable truth?that) Tj T*
(there is no way to reduce safely without eating less. It all boils down) Tj T*
(to this: No easy way is safe; no safe way is easy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_How Many Calories?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In planning the day?s food, it should be decided into which meals the) Tj T*
(essential foods will go, and their calories should be computed first.) Tj T*
(Choice may then dictate the selection of the foods to make up the rest) Tj T*
(of the day?s allowance. All foods and most beverages supply calories;) Tj T*
(therefore, it is important to know the calorie content of the usual) Tj T*
(portions of different foods. Tables which list the calories in common) Tj T*
(foods and beverages begin on page 25.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(One of the most frequently selected diets for healthy adults who need to) Tj T*
(reduce is a three-meal-a-day schedule allowing, in all, 1,200 calories.) Tj T*
(Some people, however, cannot lose weight satisfactorily on a) Tj T*
(1,200-calorie diet. The doctor may cut their daily calorie allowance to) Tj T*
(1,000 if their progress is too slow, or increase it to 1,500 if they are) Tj T*
(losing too rapidly. Examples of 1,000-, 1,200-, and 1,500-calorie diets) Tj T*
(are given on pages 16-17. Diets which fall below 1,000 calories require) Tj T*
(very close medical supervision and are usually used only in cases where) Tj T*
(a rapid loss of weight is required for serious conditions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Vitamin and mineral supplements are often prescribed for people on a) Tj T*
(reducing diet, especially if it allows less than 1,200 calories. This is) Tj T*
(to make doubly sure that the body gets all the vitamins and minerals it) Tj T*
(needs. The use of such supplements is never intended to take the place) Tj T*
(of eating the essential foods.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Some people, when they first see their reducing diet, are firmly) Tj T*
(convinced that they have never eaten as much as their present diet) Tj T*
ET
