(                      UNDERWEIGHT AND ITS DANGERS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Anyone 20 percent or more below his best weight is considered) Tj T*
(underweight. Definite underweight is not desirable in young people who) Tj T*
(are still growing. It may be a symptom of disease. The glandular) Tj T*
(disorders so often erroneously blamed for overweight are much more) Tj T*
(likely to show themselves in loss of weight or inability to gain. Even) Tj T*
(when there is nothing wrong, people whose weight is too far below normal) Tj T*
(are more likely to suffer from fatigue and poor physical endurance.) Tj T*
(Resistance to infection is often lowered. Tuberculosis strikes more) Tj T*
(often among adolescents and young people who are underweight than it) Tj T*
(does among those whose weight is closer to what it should be.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_What Causes Underweight?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Certain diseases and glandular disorders can cause underweight. In) Tj T*
(healthy people, however, underweight comes from eating too little, from) Tj T*
(poor eating habits, from over-activity or too little rest, and from) Tj T*
(worry or prolonged tension.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Many people eat too little for much the same reasons which make others) Tj T*
(eat too much. Habit frequently plays a part. Meals are irregular in some) Tj T*
(families, sometimes poorly prepared, and eating is considered the least) Tj T*
(important of the day?s activities. It is not surprising if the children) Tj T*
(from such families grow up with an indifferent attitude toward food.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Emotions may also play a part. The feeling of being unloved,) Tj T*
(dissatisfaction with personal relationships, discontent over job, money,) Tj T*
(or social restrictions, and other reasons of this kind cause some people) Tj T*
(to react with indifference to eating just as they cause others to) Tj T*
(overeat. Keen rivalry, a wish to take part in everything, or too great) Tj T*
(an absorption in school or social activities sometimes cause) Tj T*
(over-activity and underweight among adolescents.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_How to Gain Weight_) Tj T*
ET
endstream
